Repeated attempts to execute an aggregator-style SPARQL (ORDER BY / LIMIT or distinct comparison) against dbpedia timed out on the endpoint (sorting stage). However, using the list API I successfully retrieved the director IRIs and their dbo:birthDate values for both films: K. Raghavendra Rao (dbr:K._Raghavendra_Rao) has dbo:birthDate 1942-05-23 and Piero Schivazappa (dbr:Piero_Schivazappa) has dbo:birthDate 1935-04-14. From these results, the director born later is K. Raghavendra Rao (born 1942-05-23), so the film whose director was born later is dbr:Alludugaru.

The final SPARQL query I attempted (best attempt) was designed to return the film whose director has the most recent birth date; the endpoint consistently timed out when executing it.

